      568        SPACE(0.94) SKIP(0.15)
      569       WITH VIEW-AS DIALOG-BOX KEEP-TAB-ORDER
      570            SIDE-LABELS NO-UNDERLINE THREE-D  SCROLLABLE
      571            TITLE "Диапазон дат для экспорта".
      572   ASSIGN
      573          FRAME Dialog-Frame:SCROLLABLE       = FALSE
      574          FRAME Dialog-Frame:HIDDEN           = TRUE.
      575   ON WINDOW-CLOSE OF FRAME Dialog-Frame
      576   DO:
      577     APPLY "END-ERROR":U TO SELF.
